BRONZE LAYER – Raw Ingestion
 Goal
●	Store raw data as-is

●	Minimal transformation

●	CSV → Parquet

●	One table per source
PySpark Bronze Ingestion Utility
def bronze_ingestion(spark, csv_path, table_name):
    df = (
        spark.read
        .option("header", "true")
        .csv(csv_path)
    )

    (
        df.write
        .mode("overwrite")
        .format("parquet")
        .saveAsTable(f"bronze_{table_name}")
    )

    return f"bronze_{table_name}"

